  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Osh and Jalalabad Solid Waste Projects</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objectives are to achieve urgently needed investment in sanitary landfills and the upgrade of the collection and transportation system in the Cities and the neighbouring Municipalities, resulting in an improved level of solid waste services.The Action will finance critical solid waste investments for the City of Osh and four neighbouring municipalities, as well as solid waste investments for the City of Jalalabad and six neighbouring municipalities.</narrative>
  </description>
